1
00:01:27,105 --> 00:01:31,325
The Scholar and the Emperor

2
00:01:44,025 --> 00:01:45,841
I know how furious you are.

3
00:01:45,865 --> 00:01:47,761
But only by planning carefully

4
00:01:47,785 --> 00:01:49,685
can we capture them all at once.

5
00:01:59,905 --> 00:02:03,405
I watched A-Yue die before my eyes.

6
00:02:03,665 --> 00:02:05,245
How can I remain calm?

7
00:02:09,705 --> 00:02:11,645
Your Majesty, I have come
to escort you back...

8
00:02:24,745 --> 00:02:26,401
I will think carefully before acting.

9
00:02:26,425 --> 00:02:28,565
The Bureau now has the case.

10
00:02:29,105 --> 00:02:30,481
Your Majesty, please return to the palace.

11
00:02:30,505 --> 00:02:32,401
What do you plan to do next?

12
00:02:32,425 --> 00:02:33,725
I need to know.

13
00:02:34,065 --> 00:02:35,965
Otherwise, I cannot rest easy.

14
00:02:39,345 --> 00:02:41,845
Since the gambling house
has discovered my identity,

15
00:02:42,745 --> 00:02:44,441
and Lü Da bears a grudge against me,

16
00:02:44,465 --> 00:02:45,521
they will not spare me.

17
00:02:45,545 --> 00:02:47,041
I believe

18
00:02:47,065 --> 00:02:48,281
they will come looking for me.

19
00:02:48,305 --> 00:02:49,201
If they come for you,

20
00:02:49,225 --> 00:02:50,485
only two outcomes:

21
00:02:51,145 --> 00:02:52,405
recruit you,

22
00:02:52,665 --> 00:02:54,205
or kill you.

23
00:02:55,825 --> 00:02:57,405
I will handle it myself.

24
00:02:58,305 --> 00:02:59,965
Farewell, Your Majesty.

25
00:03:25,985 --> 00:03:27,321
This way, please.

26
00:03:27,345 --> 00:03:28,401
Certainly.

27
00:03:28,425 --> 00:03:29,565
Come again.

28
00:03:32,985 --> 00:03:35,045
-I'll get the shopkeeper.
-All right.

29
00:03:46,305 --> 00:03:47,401
Shopkeeper Yan.

30
00:03:47,425 --> 00:03:50,761
I am Hao Wenming, proprietor
of Xingrong Gambling House.

31
00:03:50,785 --> 00:03:52,325
Today,

32
00:03:52,985 --> 00:03:54,685
I came especially to visit...

33
00:03:56,105 --> 00:03:57,441
Official Meng.

34
00:03:57,465 --> 00:03:59,081
So it is Proprietor Hao.

35
00:03:59,105 --> 00:04:01,561
What business do you
have with Official Meng?

36
00:04:01,585 --> 00:04:02,841
Official Meng

37
00:04:02,865 --> 00:04:05,085
is not someone you may
see whenever you please.

38
00:04:05,545 --> 00:04:07,045
Shopkeeper Yan,

39
00:04:07,225 --> 00:04:09,761
I have come with tremendous sincerity

40
00:04:09,785 --> 00:04:11,685
and substantial benefits.

41
00:04:12,985 --> 00:04:15,441
This is Jade Nectar,

42
00:04:15,465 --> 00:04:16,721
made in the bitterest cold.

43
00:04:16,745 --> 00:04:18,681
Its brewing process is extremely complex.

44
00:04:18,705 --> 00:04:21,885
It is rich and bracing,
with a lingering finish.

45
00:04:22,705 --> 00:04:24,081
In the entire capital,

46
00:04:24,105 --> 00:04:26,241
only I, Hao Wenming, can obtain it.

47
00:04:26,265 --> 00:04:27,521
I can

48
00:04:27,545 --> 00:04:29,841
supply this wine
exclusively to Bofeng House

49
00:04:29,865 --> 00:04:31,285
at thirty percent

50
00:04:32,265 --> 00:04:33,201
below market price.

51
00:04:33,225 --> 00:04:35,641
Should you find that acceptable,

52
00:04:35,665 --> 00:04:38,041
we may consider this
the start of our partnership.

53
00:04:38,065 --> 00:04:40,121
In return, introduce me to Official Meng.

54
00:04:40,145 --> 00:04:42,405
What do you say?

55
00:04:46,185 --> 00:04:47,765
This wine...

56
00:04:48,025 --> 00:04:49,805
is rather interesting.

57
00:04:50,025 --> 00:04:53,245
One honored guest. Upstairs, please.

58
00:04:54,185 --> 00:04:55,445
Shopkeeper,

59
00:04:55,905 --> 00:04:57,521
what did you hear from across the street?

60
00:04:57,545 --> 00:04:58,801
I heard Proprietor Hao

61
00:04:58,825 --> 00:05:00,521
seemed to have come
especially for Official Meng.

62
00:05:00,545 --> 00:05:02,521
It seems Official Meng's case

63
00:05:02,545 --> 00:05:04,005
concerns Xingrong Gambling House.

64
00:05:04,785 --> 00:05:06,485
I knew it.

65
00:05:06,825 --> 00:05:08,561
That Yan Fuzhi and Meng Tinghui

66
00:05:08,585 --> 00:05:09,641
must have

67
00:05:09,665 --> 00:05:11,281
some shameful arrangement between them.

68
00:05:11,305 --> 00:05:12,761
-Exactly.
-Today,

69
00:05:12,785 --> 00:05:15,205
I will file a complaint against them.

70
00:05:17,225 --> 00:05:18,525
Official Meng.

71
00:05:19,265 --> 00:05:20,845
I have long heard of your reputation.

72
00:05:21,225 --> 00:05:23,081
Only after seeing you today

73
00:05:23,105 --> 00:05:26,281
do I understand beauty that
makes fish sink and geese fall,

74
00:05:26,305 --> 00:05:28,801
and talent beyond compare.

75
00:05:28,825 --> 00:05:30,921
For you to meet me today

76
00:05:30,945 --> 00:05:33,525
means my ancestors must be smiling upon me.

77
00:05:36,465 --> 00:05:37,881
My ancestors are smiling?

78
00:05:37,905 --> 00:05:39,685
My ancestral graves must have exploded.

79
00:05:40,585 --> 00:05:41,845
Listen to me ramble.

80
00:05:42,705 --> 00:05:44,121
The moment I saw Official Meng,

81
00:05:44,145 --> 00:05:45,645
I became somewhat incoherent.

82
00:05:45,905 --> 00:05:47,085
Proprietor Hao,

83
00:05:48,065 --> 00:05:50,161
one does not visit without a reason.

84
00:05:50,185 --> 00:05:51,641
What brings you here

85
00:05:51,665 --> 00:05:52,761
today?

86
00:05:52,785 --> 00:05:54,405
I heard

87
00:05:54,745 --> 00:05:57,321
that Official Meng visited
Xingrong Gambling House last night.

88
00:05:57,345 --> 00:05:59,321
I failed to welcome you personally

89
00:05:59,345 --> 00:06:01,401
or ensure you enjoyed yourself.

90
00:06:01,425 --> 00:06:02,601
It was truly inexcusable.

91
00:06:02,625 --> 00:06:03,841
So today,

92
00:06:03,865 --> 00:06:06,485
I came especially to apologize,

93
00:06:07,385 --> 00:06:08,561
and also

94
00:06:08,585 --> 00:06:10,721
to become

95
00:06:10,745 --> 00:06:13,005
kindred spirits with Official Meng

96
00:06:13,265 --> 00:06:15,045
and form a friendship.

97
00:06:19,705 --> 00:06:20,845
Official Meng.

98
00:06:24,345 --> 00:06:25,645
Open it.

99
00:06:33,545 --> 00:06:35,885
This is of exceptional quality.

100
00:06:36,585 --> 00:06:37,885
And these pearls

101
00:06:38,145 --> 00:06:40,445
are so large and perfectly round, my lord.

102
00:06:41,305 --> 00:06:43,361
You certainly have a discerning eye.

103
00:06:43,385 --> 00:06:44,525
Little brother,

104
00:06:46,465 --> 00:06:47,645
this necklace...

105
00:06:47,825 --> 00:06:48,721
No...

106
00:06:48,745 --> 00:06:50,121
Here... Take it and enjoy it.

107
00:06:50,145 --> 00:06:51,881
Official Meng and I

108
00:06:51,905 --> 00:06:53,481
are discussing a business deal today.

109
00:06:53,505 --> 00:06:54,881
Once it is settled,

110
00:06:54,905 --> 00:06:57,241
we will be brothers.

111
00:06:57,265 --> 00:06:58,761
My lord.

112
00:06:58,785 --> 00:07:00,361
Brother Hao is most sincere.

113
00:07:00,385 --> 00:07:01,525
Think it over.

114
00:07:03,345 --> 00:07:04,485
Bring two more.

115
00:07:05,425 --> 00:07:06,321
Proprietor Hao,

116
00:07:06,345 --> 00:07:07,921
I have heard Xingrong Gambling House

117
00:07:07,945 --> 00:07:09,925
has powerful patrons behind it.

118
00:07:10,225 --> 00:07:11,841
Your business

119
00:07:11,865 --> 00:07:13,321
must be far from simple.

120
00:07:13,345 --> 00:07:14,485
Official Meng.

121
00:07:15,385 --> 00:07:17,921
You truly are well informed.

122
00:07:17,945 --> 00:07:19,041
To be honest,

123
00:07:19,065 --> 00:07:20,281
our gambling house

124
00:07:20,305 --> 00:07:22,681
does have some powerful patrons.

125
00:07:22,705 --> 00:07:25,081
But those connections are minor.

126
00:07:25,105 --> 00:07:26,201
We still need

127
00:07:26,225 --> 00:07:28,641
a patron like you, Official Meng,

128
00:07:28,665 --> 00:07:30,525
to lend us your support.

129
00:07:39,945 --> 00:07:41,085
Official Meng.

130
00:07:41,665 --> 00:07:43,085
Please, sit.

131
00:07:52,505 --> 00:07:53,601
Official Meng,

132
00:07:53,625 --> 00:07:56,561
you only need to sign
this partnership agreement.

133
00:07:56,585 --> 00:07:57,801
From now on,

134
00:07:57,825 --> 00:08:00,681
we will be in the same boat.

135
00:08:00,705 --> 00:08:02,965
Since this is a partnership agreement,

136
00:08:03,225 --> 00:08:04,441
there are some things

137
00:08:04,465 --> 00:08:06,005
you must tell me honestly.

138
00:08:06,585 --> 00:08:08,201
What business

139
00:08:08,225 --> 00:08:10,525
is really conducted on the second floor?

140
00:08:11,225 --> 00:08:13,041
And who exactly

141
00:08:13,065 --> 00:08:14,921
are those masked gamblers?

142
00:08:14,945 --> 00:08:16,285
Official Meng,

143
00:08:16,625 --> 00:08:18,885
certain secrets

144
00:08:19,905 --> 00:08:23,605
may only be told to those in the same boat.

145
00:08:24,105 --> 00:08:26,445
Once you sign,

146
00:08:26,665 --> 00:08:27,721
I guarantee

147
00:08:27,745 --> 00:08:31,205
I will tell you everything I know.

148
00:08:34,825 --> 00:08:35,921
Official Meng,

149
00:08:35,945 --> 00:08:37,241
why do you hesitate?

150
00:08:37,265 --> 00:08:39,401
Do you not trust me,

151
00:08:39,425 --> 00:08:42,525
or do you not wish to become one of us?

152
00:08:43,265 --> 00:08:44,881
I am only wondering

153
00:08:44,905 --> 00:08:47,165
whether a mere twenty percent

154
00:08:47,945 --> 00:08:50,285
is worth risking my official post.

155
00:08:51,665 --> 00:08:52,761
Exactly.

156
00:08:52,785 --> 00:08:54,041
I demand at least...

157
00:08:54,065 --> 00:08:55,485
-Sev...
-Thirty percent.

158
00:08:58,985 --> 00:09:00,485
Thirty percent.

159
00:09:01,305 --> 00:09:02,361
Not a fraction less,

160
00:09:02,385 --> 00:09:04,721
or this agreement is void.

161
00:09:04,745 --> 00:09:06,125
Official Meng,

162
00:09:06,745 --> 00:09:08,881
you certainly know how to bargain.

163
00:09:08,905 --> 00:09:10,805
Thirty percent it is.

164
00:09:17,545 --> 00:09:18,961
-Bring a brush.
-My lord.

165
00:09:18,985 --> 00:09:20,525
On second thought,

166
00:09:20,705 --> 00:09:22,721
signing this agreement

167
00:09:22,745 --> 00:09:24,161
may leave evidence against me.

168
00:09:24,185 --> 00:09:26,205
-Bring the brush.
-Little brother.

169
00:09:40,585 --> 00:09:43,125
Official Meng, how decisive.

170
00:09:44,745 --> 00:09:46,125
Proprietor Hao,

171
00:09:47,185 --> 00:09:48,641
what about what I asked earlier?

172
00:09:48,665 --> 00:09:51,045
We are on the same side now.

173
00:09:51,385 --> 00:09:52,561
Let us drink and talk.

174
00:09:52,585 --> 00:09:54,205
-Come.
-Come.

175
00:10:04,385 --> 00:10:05,721
Well...

176
00:10:05,745 --> 00:10:06,841
On the second floor,

177
00:10:06,865 --> 00:10:09,045
certain special guests

178
00:10:09,545 --> 00:10:12,005
require special entertainment.

179
00:10:12,865 --> 00:10:15,205
You understand, little brother.

180
00:10:15,985 --> 00:10:16,961
I understand...

181
00:10:16,985 --> 00:10:18,601
Come, little brother.

182
00:10:18,625 --> 00:10:19,925
-Come.
-Cheers.

183
00:10:23,385 --> 00:10:24,725
I heard

184
00:10:25,545 --> 00:10:27,405
the once-every-fortnight...

185
00:10:28,345 --> 00:10:30,165
Flower Banquet

186
00:10:31,305 --> 00:10:33,645
is quite lively.

187
00:10:34,625 --> 00:10:35,765
Brother.

188
00:10:37,945 --> 00:10:39,881
Come, little brother.

189
00:10:39,905 --> 00:10:41,081
Come, little brother.

190
00:10:41,105 --> 00:10:42,445
As for me,

191
00:10:42,985 --> 00:10:45,921
I would also like to join the fun

192
00:10:45,945 --> 00:10:47,605
and see it for myself.

193
00:10:49,345 --> 00:10:50,725
Normally,

194
00:10:51,265 --> 00:10:53,405
since we are now one of us,

195
00:10:53,745 --> 00:10:55,081
going upstairs

196
00:10:55,105 --> 00:10:56,685
would be no problem.

197
00:10:57,625 --> 00:10:58,845
However...

198
00:11:01,105 --> 00:11:02,725
What are you looking for, brother?

199
00:11:06,105 --> 00:11:07,921
Tomorrow's Flower Banquet

200
00:11:07,945 --> 00:11:10,045
will not be held upstairs.

201
00:11:10,625 --> 00:11:14,321
It will be at our leader's
estate in the western suburbs,

202
00:11:14,345 --> 00:11:15,485
Spring Night Courtyard.

203
00:11:15,985 --> 00:11:18,841
That is not a place just anyone can enter.

204
00:11:18,865 --> 00:11:20,481
Even if you wish to go,

205
00:11:20,505 --> 00:11:22,205
you must wait.

206
00:11:24,385 --> 00:11:25,685
Brother,

207
00:11:27,025 --> 00:11:29,321
your leader is truly mysterious.

208
00:11:29,345 --> 00:11:31,201
The last time I met him,

209
00:11:31,225 --> 00:11:32,401
he nearly killed me.

210
00:11:32,425 --> 00:11:34,441
As the saying goes,

211
00:11:34,465 --> 00:11:37,605
friendship often follows a fight.

212
00:11:38,225 --> 00:11:39,961
Come, have a drink.

213
00:11:39,985 --> 00:11:41,241
Come, little brother.

214
00:11:41,265 --> 00:11:42,405
Official Meng.

215
00:11:43,185 --> 00:11:45,325
What was your leader's name again?

216
00:11:48,185 --> 00:11:50,325
Ling Yunfei.

217
00:11:51,465 --> 00:11:53,641
Ling Yunfei.

218
00:11:53,665 --> 00:11:56,241
Fei...

219
00:11:56,265 --> 00:11:57,885
Fei.

220
00:12:08,145 --> 00:12:10,641
She is nothing but
a greedy female official.

221
00:12:10,665 --> 00:12:12,445
Now that she has signed the agreement,

222
00:12:12,665 --> 00:12:15,241
she will have to obey me.

223
00:12:15,265 --> 00:12:16,241
Leader,

224
00:12:16,265 --> 00:12:17,161
Meng Tinghui

225
00:12:17,185 --> 00:12:19,641
obediently signed the agreement.

226
00:12:19,665 --> 00:12:21,441
From now on,

227
00:12:21,465 --> 00:12:23,245
she can no longer interfere with us.

228
00:12:23,425 --> 00:12:24,765
You can trust

229
00:12:25,025 --> 00:12:26,441
how I handle matters.

230
00:12:26,465 --> 00:12:28,325
These officials

231
00:12:28,905 --> 00:12:30,805
act virtuous in public,

232
00:12:31,265 --> 00:12:33,081
but engage in sordid dealings in private.

233
00:12:33,105 --> 00:12:34,721
Their greatest fear is exposure.

234
00:12:34,745 --> 00:12:36,201
Over the years,

235
00:12:36,225 --> 00:12:37,965
we have used these agreements

236
00:12:38,385 --> 00:12:40,241
to control many officials in the capital.

237
00:12:40,265 --> 00:12:41,961
It seems

238
00:12:41,985 --> 00:12:43,485
Meng Tinghui

239
00:12:44,385 --> 00:12:46,045
is nothing special after all.

240
00:12:49,065 --> 00:12:51,885
Meng Tinghui nearly died by my hand.

241
00:12:52,185 --> 00:12:53,921
without even blinking.

242
00:12:53,945 --> 00:12:55,441
One drinking session was enough?

243
00:12:55,465 --> 00:12:57,121
It was more than one drinking session.

244
00:12:57,145 --> 00:12:59,201
There was also a large
chest of gold, silver, and jewels.

245
00:12:59,225 --> 00:13:00,201
She will also receive

246
00:13:00,225 --> 00:13:01,521
thirty percent of our profits.

247
00:13:01,545 --> 00:13:02,841
How generous of you.

248
00:13:02,865 --> 00:13:04,481
Exactly how many secrets

249
00:13:04,505 --> 00:13:06,245
did you reveal to her while drunk?

250
00:13:16,625 --> 00:13:17,805
My lord, be careful.

251
00:13:19,065 --> 00:13:20,441
This Flower Banquet

252
00:13:20,465 --> 00:13:22,281
is even more remote than I imagined.

253
00:13:22,305 --> 00:13:23,201
Do not worry, my lord.

254
00:13:23,225 --> 00:13:25,001
As long as we follow
Hao Wenming's carriage,

255
00:13:25,025 --> 00:13:26,081
we will be able to track them.

256
00:13:26,105 --> 00:13:27,321
My lord,

257
00:13:27,345 --> 00:13:29,601
His Majesty has not yet
replied to our secret memorial.

258
00:13:29,625 --> 00:13:31,441
Acting now exceeds our authority.

259
00:13:31,465 --> 00:13:32,401
Not this again.

260
00:13:32,425 --> 00:13:33,961
If we await approval for everything,

261
00:13:33,985 --> 00:13:35,361
it will be far too late.

262
00:13:35,385 --> 00:13:37,241
Go back if you are afraid.

263
00:13:37,265 --> 00:13:38,561
Had I truly been afraid,

264
00:13:38,585 --> 00:13:40,201
I would not be here.

265
00:13:40,225 --> 00:13:41,761
I was appointed Assistant
Director by imperial decree.

266
00:13:41,785 --> 00:13:43,361
I follow the laws of the court,

267
00:13:43,385 --> 00:13:44,281
unlike you,

268
00:13:44,305 --> 00:13:45,401
who relies only on clever tricks

269
00:13:45,425 --> 00:13:46,721
and reckless schemes.

270
00:13:46,745 --> 00:13:48,365
Reckless schemes?

271
00:13:48,665 --> 00:13:50,805
Your laws are useless

272
00:13:51,585 --> 00:13:53,081
against the Tiger Roar Gang.

273
00:13:53,105 --> 00:13:54,445
Stop arguing.

274
00:13:54,865 --> 00:13:56,245
We must adapt in an emergency.

275
00:13:56,785 --> 00:13:57,961
Let us follow them first.

276
00:13:57,985 --> 00:13:59,325
We must keep our distance.

277
00:14:48,345 --> 00:14:49,485
No!

278
00:14:58,265 --> 00:14:59,565
Get away!

279
00:15:08,705 --> 00:15:10,485
The Leader truly foresaw everything.

280
00:15:11,425 --> 00:15:12,605
The guards reported

281
00:15:13,225 --> 00:15:14,881
that Meng Tinghui and two trusted aides

282
00:15:14,905 --> 00:15:16,081
have gone to Spring Night Courtyard.

283
00:15:16,105 --> 00:15:18,965
Everything is within the Leader's grasp.

284
00:15:20,825 --> 00:15:22,201
Exactly how many secrets

285
00:15:22,225 --> 00:15:23,881
did you reveal to her while drunk?

286
00:15:23,905 --> 00:15:25,601
Leader, do not worry.

287
00:15:25,625 --> 00:15:27,401
I kept distracting her with idle chatter.

288
00:15:27,425 --> 00:15:29,001
I also held something back.

289
00:15:29,025 --> 00:15:31,441
I deliberately gave her a false
location for the Flower Banquet.

290
00:15:31,465 --> 00:15:32,841
Even if she goes there,

291
00:15:32,865 --> 00:15:33,841
she will find nothing.

292
00:15:33,865 --> 00:15:35,005
That is not enough.

293
00:15:36,145 --> 00:15:37,645
If she dares come,

294
00:15:38,465 --> 00:15:40,925
I will ensure she never leaves.

295
00:15:50,865 --> 00:15:52,841
Are we abandoning the carriage? This...

296
00:15:52,865 --> 00:15:54,005
Are we here?

297
00:15:54,665 --> 00:15:55,845
Let us go take a look.

298
00:15:58,185 --> 00:15:59,325
My lord...

299
00:16:32,785 --> 00:16:33,965
Run!

300
00:16:38,625 --> 00:16:39,961
Is there enough gunpowder?

301
00:16:39,985 --> 00:16:41,121
Do not worry, Leader.

302
00:16:41,145 --> 00:16:43,405
It will blow them to ashes.

303
00:17:07,665 --> 00:17:08,881
I heard the Xiyan flower

304
00:17:08,905 --> 00:17:10,721
is greatly beloved in Beijian.

305
00:17:10,745 --> 00:17:13,081
Many musicians often
wear it as an ornament.

306
00:17:13,105 --> 00:17:14,481
I specifically ordered

307
00:17:14,505 --> 00:17:16,561
the banquet decorated with these flowers.

308
00:17:16,585 --> 00:17:18,525
I wonder whether they please the envoys.

309
00:17:19,385 --> 00:17:20,481
We appreciate

310
00:17:20,505 --> 00:17:21,725
Your Majesty's kindness.

311
00:17:21,985 --> 00:17:24,601
However, Beijian is bitterly
cold throughout the year

312
00:17:24,625 --> 00:17:26,321
and has always prized the snow lotus.

313
00:17:26,345 --> 00:17:28,321
This Xiyan flower is rarely seen there.

314
00:17:28,345 --> 00:17:29,925
I see.

315
00:17:30,465 --> 00:17:33,521
I wondered why so many
treasures presented by your kingdom

316
00:17:33,545 --> 00:17:35,681
were intricately carved
with snow-lotus patterns.

317
00:17:35,705 --> 00:17:37,201
Now I understand.

318
00:17:37,225 --> 00:17:38,961
By order of our sovereign,

319
00:17:38,985 --> 00:17:39,961
I have come to pay homage.

320
00:17:39,985 --> 00:17:42,081
We wish only for Beijian and Great Ning

321
00:17:42,105 --> 00:17:43,361
to remain bound in lasting friendship.

322
00:17:43,385 --> 00:17:45,441
Great Ning likewise wishes

323
00:17:45,465 --> 00:17:46,921
to maintain friendly
relations with Beijian,

324
00:17:46,945 --> 00:17:48,485
securing peace along the frontier.

325
00:18:22,225 --> 00:18:23,685
Zhili.

326
00:18:24,185 --> 00:18:25,325
Zhili.

327
00:18:30,585 --> 00:18:32,045
My lord.

328
00:18:34,625 --> 00:18:35,521
My lord.

329
00:18:35,545 --> 00:18:36,561
You are injured.

330
00:18:36,585 --> 00:18:37,725
I have medicine.

331
00:18:38,185 --> 00:18:39,325
Are you all right?

332
00:18:43,585 --> 00:18:44,561
Yin Qing.

333
00:18:44,585 --> 00:18:46,005
Are you all right?

334
00:18:46,865 --> 00:18:48,005
I am fine.

335
00:18:49,545 --> 00:18:51,285
It is only a superficial wound.

336
00:18:58,145 --> 00:18:59,325
This carriage

337
00:18:59,585 --> 00:19:01,041
was never heading to
Spring Night Courtyard.

338
00:19:01,065 --> 00:19:03,281
Where can we find the
real Flower Banquet now?

339
00:19:03,305 --> 00:19:06,285
I know where the Flower Banquet really is.

340
00:19:19,305 --> 00:19:20,805
Leader.

341
00:19:35,345 --> 00:19:36,485
Stop!

342
00:19:43,145 --> 00:19:44,405
Do not move!

343
00:19:45,665 --> 00:19:46,805
Do not move!

344
00:19:50,945 --> 00:19:52,765
Do not move. Kneel!

345
00:19:53,305 --> 00:19:54,645
You animals!

346
00:19:58,545 --> 00:20:00,561
Official Meng, little brother,

347
00:20:00,585 --> 00:20:02,521
what is the meaning of this spectacle?

348
00:20:02,545 --> 00:20:04,361
Are you here to destroy my business?

349
00:20:04,385 --> 00:20:07,041
Hao Wenming, relying on
the Tiger Roar Gang's power,

350
00:20:07,065 --> 00:20:08,241
used gambling as a cover

351
00:20:08,265 --> 00:20:09,161
to traffic women.

352
00:20:09,185 --> 00:20:10,561
You have now been caught red-handed.

353
00:20:10,585 --> 00:20:11,841
Official Meng,

354
00:20:11,865 --> 00:20:13,921
do not falsely accuse an innocent man.

355
00:20:13,945 --> 00:20:15,641
We are merely holding a banquet

356
00:20:15,665 --> 00:20:16,801
and playing a few games.

357
00:20:16,825 --> 00:20:18,081
Games?

358
00:20:18,105 --> 00:20:19,481
Allowing women to be humiliated at will

359
00:20:19,505 --> 00:20:21,765
is what you call a game?

360
00:20:22,465 --> 00:20:23,925
Official Meng.

361
00:20:24,345 --> 00:20:26,681
Why get so angry?

362
00:20:26,705 --> 00:20:27,681
We are all on the same side.

363
00:20:27,705 --> 00:20:28,801
They are all our own people.

364
00:20:28,825 --> 00:20:29,841
Who is on your side?

365
00:20:29,865 --> 00:20:31,401
My lord is innocent and upright.

366
00:20:31,425 --> 00:20:33,165
How dare you slander her?

367
00:20:37,425 --> 00:20:38,645
Little brother,

368
00:20:39,545 --> 00:20:42,241
why turn on me now?

369
00:20:42,265 --> 00:20:43,641
A few days ago, I gave you a necklace

370
00:20:43,665 --> 00:20:45,401
-worth a fortune...
-Enough nonsense.

371
00:20:45,425 --> 00:20:46,321
Arrest them.

372
00:20:46,345 --> 00:20:48,485
-Wait...
-Outrageous!

373
00:20:55,145 --> 00:20:56,721
Under the Son of Heaven's very feet,

374
00:20:56,745 --> 00:20:58,841
such depravity is being committed.

375
00:20:58,865 --> 00:21:00,321
The Court arrived just in time.

376
00:21:00,345 --> 00:21:01,401
Vice Minister Zheng.

377
00:21:01,425 --> 00:21:02,561
These animals...

378
00:21:02,585 --> 00:21:03,921
I received a report from the people

379
00:21:03,945 --> 00:21:05,721
accusing Meng Tinghui of taking bribes

380
00:21:05,745 --> 00:21:06,961
and engaging in group debauchery.

381
00:21:06,985 --> 00:21:08,485
I have come to investigate thoroughly.

382
00:21:08,905 --> 00:21:10,045
An obscene gathering?

383
00:21:10,305 --> 00:21:11,801
My lord came here to investigate a case.

384
00:21:11,825 --> 00:21:12,721
There must be a misunderstanding.

385
00:21:12,745 --> 00:21:15,405
I have already sent men to
search Bofeng House for illicit property.

386
00:21:15,665 --> 00:21:16,921
Whether this is a misunderstanding

387
00:21:16,945 --> 00:21:18,325
will soon be clear.

388
00:21:23,265 --> 00:21:24,525
Hurry...

389
00:21:25,145 --> 00:21:26,601
Officers,

390
00:21:26,625 --> 00:21:27,761
what is happening?

391
00:21:27,785 --> 00:21:29,161
-Search the place.
-Yes.

392
00:21:29,185 --> 00:21:30,481
You...

393
00:21:30,505 --> 00:21:32,161
What are you doing?

394
00:21:32,185 --> 00:21:34,845
Vice Minister Zheng, please judge fairly.

395
00:21:35,225 --> 00:21:36,681
Meng Tinghui abused her authority

396
00:21:36,705 --> 00:21:38,921
and forced me to sign an agreement

397
00:21:38,945 --> 00:21:41,801
giving her thirty percent of
my gambling house's profits.

398
00:21:41,825 --> 00:21:43,001
She threatened

399
00:21:43,025 --> 00:21:44,605
that if I refused,

400
00:21:45,745 --> 00:21:48,201
she would make trouble
for my gambling house.

401
00:21:48,225 --> 00:21:49,845
Hao Wenming,

402
00:21:50,545 --> 00:21:53,125
you are quite skilled at
making false accusations.

403
00:21:53,865 --> 00:21:54,761
Vice Minister Zheng,

404
00:21:54,785 --> 00:21:55,921
please look.

405
00:21:55,945 --> 00:21:57,921
It is written clearly here

406
00:21:57,945 --> 00:22:00,405
with Meng Tinghui's own signature.

407
00:22:16,545 --> 00:22:17,641
This...

408
00:22:17,665 --> 00:22:18,761
Proprietor Hao,

409
00:22:18,785 --> 00:22:20,281
where is the handwriting you mentioned?

410
00:22:20,305 --> 00:22:21,721
You dare

411
00:22:21,745 --> 00:22:23,441
slander an imperial
official without evidence?

412
00:22:23,465 --> 00:22:24,481
My lord.

413
00:22:24,505 --> 00:22:25,441
Proprietor Hao,

414
00:22:25,465 --> 00:22:26,961
perhaps you are still drunk?

415
00:22:26,985 --> 00:22:28,841
Are you playing tricks with me?

416
00:22:28,865 --> 00:22:30,001
Uncle Hao.

417
00:22:30,025 --> 00:22:31,681
There is also a chest of gold,
silver, and jewels.

418
00:22:31,705 --> 00:22:34,001
Yes, a chest of jewels.

419
00:22:34,025 --> 00:22:36,845
She extorted it from me as a deposit.

420
00:22:41,665 --> 00:22:43,681
My lord, these are the illicit goods

421
00:22:43,705 --> 00:22:44,845
we found at Bofeng House.

422
00:22:46,505 --> 00:22:48,721
This is the evidence.

423
00:22:48,745 --> 00:22:50,481
Vice Minister Zheng,

424
00:22:50,505 --> 00:22:52,401
please uphold justice for us.

425
00:22:52,425 --> 00:22:54,441
This is my personal property,

426
00:22:54,465 --> 00:22:55,601
not illicit goods.

427
00:22:55,625 --> 00:22:56,841
Nonsense.

428
00:22:56,865 --> 00:22:59,161
You are merely a newly
appointed sixth-rank official.

429
00:22:59,185 --> 00:23:00,321
Where did you get so much wealth?

430
00:23:00,345 --> 00:23:02,881
It was naturally a gift from my
lord's dear friend, Shopkeeper Yan,

431
00:23:02,905 --> 00:23:04,121
to thank my lord

432
00:23:04,145 --> 00:23:05,921
for devising strategies
to run Bofeng House.

433
00:23:05,945 --> 00:23:07,121
Bullshit!

434
00:23:07,145 --> 00:23:08,761
That is all my silver.

435
00:23:08,785 --> 00:23:10,321
I am telling you, these chests

436
00:23:10,345 --> 00:23:12,601
were specially made for
Xingrong Gambling House

437
00:23:12,625 --> 00:23:14,681
and bear our seal.

438
00:23:14,705 --> 00:23:16,081
Do you dare let the soldiers inspect them?

439
00:23:16,105 --> 00:23:17,805
This is my lord's property.

440
00:23:18,225 --> 00:23:19,161
Why should you search it?

441
00:23:19,185 --> 00:23:20,481
This is outright harassment.

442
00:23:20,505 --> 00:23:21,561
You cannot determine ownership

443
00:23:21,585 --> 00:23:22,845
from a seal alone.

444
00:23:23,585 --> 00:23:25,801
That is far too careless.
I refuse to accept it.

445
00:23:25,825 --> 00:23:27,721
Stop twisting the facts!

446
00:23:27,745 --> 00:23:29,081
If the bottom of the chest

447
00:23:29,105 --> 00:23:31,161
bears Xingrong Gambling House's seal,

448
00:23:31,185 --> 00:23:32,321
then it is my silver.

449
00:23:32,345 --> 00:23:33,721
If it bears Bofeng House's seal,

450
00:23:33,745 --> 00:23:35,245
then it is yours.

451
00:23:35,505 --> 00:23:37,005
You are feeling guilty.

452
00:23:37,945 --> 00:23:39,525
Move aside.

453
00:23:40,305 --> 00:23:41,445
Hands off.

454
00:23:46,905 --> 00:23:47,881
My lord.

455
00:23:47,905 --> 00:23:49,165
Please look.

456
00:23:55,265 --> 00:23:56,565
This...

457
00:23:59,945 --> 00:24:01,285
Proprietor Hao,

458
00:24:02,185 --> 00:24:03,441
you just said yourself

459
00:24:03,465 --> 00:24:05,441
that the silver belongs to whoever's seal

460
00:24:05,465 --> 00:24:07,165
appears on the bottom of the chest.

461
00:24:07,865 --> 00:24:09,761
Vice Minister Zheng and all the officers

462
00:24:09,785 --> 00:24:11,321
saw it with your own eyes.

463
00:24:11,345 --> 00:24:13,521
The bottom bears Bofeng House's seal.

464
00:24:13,545 --> 00:24:16,045
Therefore, the silver belongs to my lord.

465
00:24:20,785 --> 00:24:21,681
Hao Wenming,

466
00:24:21,705 --> 00:24:24,201
from the moment you
handed me the agreement,

467
00:24:24,225 --> 00:24:25,925
you had already lost.

468
00:24:26,745 --> 00:24:28,721
I played this entire scene with you.

469
00:24:28,745 --> 00:24:29,885
Are you satisfied?

470
00:24:30,865 --> 00:24:32,761
Meng... Meng Tinghui,

471
00:24:32,785 --> 00:24:34,721
you...

472
00:24:34,745 --> 00:24:37,801
Vice Minister Zheng,
please investigate carefully.

473
00:24:37,825 --> 00:24:39,521
She must have tampered with it.

474
00:24:39,545 --> 00:24:41,845
You must redress our grievance.

475
00:24:43,185 --> 00:24:44,081
Meng Tinghui,

476
00:24:44,105 --> 00:24:45,481
you have always acted recklessly.

477
00:24:45,505 --> 00:24:47,041
A few words from your people

478
00:24:47,065 --> 00:24:48,485
cannot clear your suspicion.

479
00:24:48,905 --> 00:24:50,201
Come with me to the Court.

480
00:24:50,225 --> 00:24:51,641
If you are innocent,

481
00:24:51,665 --> 00:24:53,081
I will see justice done.

482
00:24:53,105 --> 00:24:56,005
The Court cannot interfere
with a Bureau investigation.

483
00:24:56,985 --> 00:24:59,161
If Vice Minister Zheng
wishes to question anyone,

484
00:24:59,185 --> 00:25:00,401
wait until we take them

485
00:25:00,425 --> 00:25:01,401
back to the Bureau.

486
00:25:01,425 --> 00:25:03,085
I am acting according to the law.

487
00:25:03,625 --> 00:25:05,525
I will not allow you to obstruct me.

488
00:25:06,585 --> 00:25:09,125
That man wears a red jade thumb ring

489
00:25:09,425 --> 00:25:11,205
engraved with a caged bird.

490
00:25:18,745 --> 00:25:21,081
You are the one who harmed A-Yue.

491
00:25:21,105 --> 00:25:23,041
You colluded with Hao Wenming

492
00:25:23,065 --> 00:25:24,841
and all the gamblers

493
00:25:24,865 --> 00:25:25,761
at the Flower Banquet.

494
00:25:25,785 --> 00:25:28,841
You did not come here to investigate today.

495
00:25:28,865 --> 00:25:30,525
You came for me.

496
00:25:32,105 --> 00:25:33,481
Meng Tinghui,

497
00:25:33,505 --> 00:25:34,761
stop speaking nonsense.

498
00:25:34,785 --> 00:25:36,801
A-Yue's testimony is at the Bureau.

499
00:25:36,825 --> 00:25:38,165
If you deny it,

500
00:25:38,545 --> 00:25:40,165
you can confront her here and now.

501
00:25:43,145 --> 00:25:45,285
You are merely a sixth-rank official.

502
00:25:45,665 --> 00:25:47,045
What can you possibly do to me?

503
00:25:47,305 --> 00:25:49,321
Open your eyes and look carefully.

504
00:25:49,345 --> 00:25:51,161
This is the staff bestowed by His Majesty.

505
00:25:51,185 --> 00:25:53,321
If only one of us

506
00:25:53,345 --> 00:25:54,765
can leave this gambling house alive,

507
00:25:55,505 --> 00:25:57,001
it will certainly be me.

508
00:25:57,025 --> 00:25:58,201
Divine Guard, hear my command.

509
00:25:58,225 --> 00:25:59,921
Anyone who takes another step

510
00:25:59,945 --> 00:26:01,965
is to be executed on the spot.

511
00:26:05,745 --> 00:26:06,885
His Majesty has arrived.

512
00:26:18,545 --> 00:26:20,801
Remove the masks

513
00:26:20,825 --> 00:26:22,161
from these beasts.

514
00:26:22,185 --> 00:26:23,365
Yes.

515
00:26:26,225 --> 00:26:28,321
Is that not Academician
Liu of the Hanlin Academy?

516
00:26:28,345 --> 00:26:30,041
You certainly remain
vigorous despite your age.

517
00:26:30,065 --> 00:26:31,321
Assistant Shen,

518
00:26:31,345 --> 00:26:32,841
you... You have mistaken
me for someone else.

519
00:26:32,865 --> 00:26:35,285
Is that not Vice Minister Zhang of Revenue?

520
00:26:36,105 --> 00:26:37,001
These gentlemen here

521
00:26:37,025 --> 00:26:38,845
also look rather familiar.

522
00:26:39,105 --> 00:26:41,001
What a fine group of hypocritical

523
00:26:41,025 --> 00:26:42,641
parasites of the state.

524
00:26:42,665 --> 00:26:44,201
Since you are all so afraid

525
00:26:44,225 --> 00:26:45,601
to show your true faces,

526
00:26:45,625 --> 00:26:47,641
let them remain dressed like this

527
00:26:47,665 --> 00:26:49,921
and parade them from the
gambling house to the imperial prison.

528
00:26:49,945 --> 00:26:52,001
Let the people of the capital see

529
00:26:52,025 --> 00:26:53,321
what kind of beasts

530
00:26:53,345 --> 00:26:55,645
hide beneath these fine robes.

531
00:26:56,105 --> 00:26:57,241
Zheng and his accomplices

532
00:26:57,265 --> 00:26:58,801
are to be imprisoned immediately

533
00:26:58,825 --> 00:27:00,405
to await judgment.

534
00:27:01,025 --> 00:27:02,481
-Move.
-Move.

535
00:27:02,505 --> 00:27:05,085
You two, stop standing there.

536
00:27:12,345 --> 00:27:13,241
Your Majesty,

537
00:27:13,265 --> 00:27:15,361
may these women

538
00:27:15,385 --> 00:27:16,561
be placed under the Bureau's care?

539
00:27:16,585 --> 00:27:19,085
I place this case entirely in your hands.

540
00:27:21,385 --> 00:27:22,565
Thank you, Your Majesty.

541
00:27:23,385 --> 00:27:24,525
Yin Qing.

542
00:27:25,905 --> 00:27:28,125
Get up. It is all right now.

543
00:27:35,065 --> 00:27:36,285
Thank you, Your Majesty.

544
00:27:45,545 --> 00:27:48,641
Official Meng's skill at
swapping one thing for another

545
00:27:48,665 --> 00:27:50,485
has certainly improved.

546
00:27:51,105 --> 00:27:52,001
Well?

547
00:27:52,025 --> 00:27:53,845
Will you confess honestly on your own,

548
00:27:54,145 --> 00:27:55,285
or shall I wait...

549
00:28:10,825 --> 00:28:12,085
Stop pretending.

550
00:28:12,385 --> 00:28:14,481
Only the two of us are here.

551
00:28:14,505 --> 00:28:16,161
If you continue pretending,

552
00:28:16,185 --> 00:28:18,325
you may truly sleep until tomorrow morning.

553
00:28:30,105 --> 00:28:31,565
Your Majesty,

554
00:28:31,785 --> 00:28:34,285
I deserve ten thousand deaths.

555
00:28:38,425 --> 00:28:41,001
My first fault was failing to
report to Your Majesty beforehand.

556
00:28:41,025 --> 00:28:42,881
The situation was urgent,

557
00:28:42,905 --> 00:28:44,725
and I did not wish to miss the opportunity.

558
00:28:45,065 --> 00:28:45,961
My second fault

559
00:28:45,985 --> 00:28:49,165
was accepting Hao Wenming's wealth.

560
00:28:49,425 --> 00:28:51,001
But I did not do so out of greed.

561
00:28:51,025 --> 00:28:52,641
It was only to gain his trust.

562
00:28:52,665 --> 00:28:53,885
Furthermore,

563
00:28:54,185 --> 00:28:56,205
I did not truly sign the agreement.

564
00:29:01,825 --> 00:29:03,641
Your Majesty, that is all.

565
00:29:03,665 --> 00:29:05,485
In that case,

566
00:29:05,665 --> 00:29:07,641
not only are you blameless,

567
00:29:07,665 --> 00:29:09,605
but you anticipated every possibility.

568
00:29:09,905 --> 00:29:12,321
You even calculated precisely
when to send Zhili for reinforcements,

569
00:29:12,345 --> 00:29:14,161
without the slightest error,

570
00:29:14,185 --> 00:29:17,245
allowing me the honor of witnessing

571
00:29:19,065 --> 00:29:21,761
the deep sisterly bond between
Official Meng and Shopkeeper Yan,

572
00:29:21,785 --> 00:29:24,321
as you boldly claimed black was white

573
00:29:24,345 --> 00:29:25,601
and the greedy were incorruptible.

574
00:29:25,625 --> 00:29:27,001
I never expected Official Meng

575
00:29:27,025 --> 00:29:30,165
to possess the bearing of
such a treacherous minister.

576
00:29:30,745 --> 00:29:32,601
So Your Majesty knew all along.

577
00:29:32,625 --> 00:29:34,405
Rise and speak.

578
00:29:40,705 --> 00:29:41,681
I want to know:

579
00:29:41,705 --> 00:29:42,801
had I

580
00:29:42,825 --> 00:29:44,725
not arrived in time today,

581
00:29:46,585 --> 00:29:48,481
how would you have resolved matters?

582
00:29:48,505 --> 00:29:49,721
I had the Divine Guard.

583
00:29:49,745 --> 00:29:51,801
The Divine Guard now belongs to you?

584
00:29:51,825 --> 00:29:53,525
Naturally, they belong to Your Majesty.

585
00:29:55,185 --> 00:29:57,201
The Tiger Roar Gang's money
also belongs to Your Majesty

586
00:29:57,225 --> 00:29:59,281
and is not supervised
by the Left Chancellor.

587
00:29:59,305 --> 00:30:00,925
Your Majesty may use it freely.

588
00:30:02,625 --> 00:30:03,805
Very well.

589
00:30:04,105 --> 00:30:05,525
It seems Official Meng

590
00:30:05,825 --> 00:30:07,601
can now even earn

591
00:30:07,625 --> 00:30:09,085
private funds for me,

592
00:30:09,545 --> 00:30:11,321
using silver to silence me

593
00:30:11,345 --> 00:30:13,325
and leaving me unable to blame you.

594
00:30:21,265 --> 00:30:22,881
I humbly beg Your Majesty

595
00:30:22,905 --> 00:30:24,401
to forgive me this once.

596
00:30:24,425 --> 00:30:25,801
Those women

597
00:30:25,825 --> 00:30:28,041
wished to leave their hometowns
through their own efforts.

598
00:30:28,065 --> 00:30:29,921
They were educated and principled,

599
00:30:29,945 --> 00:30:31,645
seeking only to serve the realm.

600
00:30:32,825 --> 00:30:34,205
Seeing them...

601
00:30:34,465 --> 00:30:36,005
suffering such torment

602
00:30:36,265 --> 00:30:37,805
breaks my heart.

603
00:30:38,185 --> 00:30:40,645
I had to obtain justice for them.

604
00:30:42,705 --> 00:30:45,005
I humbly beg Your Majesty...

605
00:30:50,865 --> 00:30:53,481
I never said I would punish you.

606
00:30:53,505 --> 00:30:55,565
Yet you began pleading guilty on your own.

607
00:30:55,985 --> 00:30:57,645
Enough pretending. Get up.

608
00:31:02,225 --> 00:31:03,365
Meng Tinghui.

609
00:31:14,465 --> 00:31:17,525
You have a fever, yet
you still force yourself.

610
00:32:20,065 --> 00:32:21,441
You are selfish and self-serving,

611
00:32:21,465 --> 00:32:22,801
and every word from your mouth is a lie.

612
00:32:22,825 --> 00:32:24,521
Once exposed, you resort
to clever arguments.

613
00:32:24,545 --> 00:32:27,041
Pretending innocence and acting
pitiful come naturally to you.

614
00:32:27,065 --> 00:32:29,401
You are cunning, deceitful,
and duplicitous.

615
00:32:29,425 --> 00:32:31,361
How do I know you are not deceiving me?

616
00:32:31,385 --> 00:32:34,205
Young Master remembers me remarkably well.

617
00:32:37,625 --> 00:32:39,761
What skill is there

618
00:32:39,785 --> 00:32:41,405
in bullying a helpless woman?

619
00:32:41,665 --> 00:32:42,801
Those who dare deceive me

620
00:32:42,825 --> 00:32:44,601
have only death awaiting them.

621
00:32:44,625 --> 00:32:45,761
You accursed jinx.

622
00:32:45,785 --> 00:32:47,165
Do not come back, shameless woman.

623
00:32:53,585 --> 00:32:55,681
This time,

624
00:32:55,705 --> 00:32:57,445
we are truly even.

625
00:33:17,545 --> 00:33:19,405
So you also have

626
00:33:19,705 --> 00:33:21,125
such an obedient side.

627
00:33:30,505 --> 00:33:32,365
My lord, the medicine is ready.

628
00:33:34,305 --> 00:33:35,445
Your Majesty.

629
00:33:35,905 --> 00:33:37,521
It is so late. You are still here?

630
00:33:37,545 --> 00:33:39,361
Why are you here so late?

631
00:33:39,385 --> 00:33:41,481
-Without even knocking.
-Your Majesty.

632
00:33:41,505 --> 00:33:43,601
My lord was injured today

633
00:33:43,625 --> 00:33:46,041
and was also frightened
after being taken hostage.

634
00:33:46,065 --> 00:33:47,881
So I prepared a bowl of
medicinal decoction for her.

635
00:33:47,905 --> 00:33:50,121
Let her drink it when she wakes tomorrow.

636
00:33:50,145 --> 00:33:51,041
You may leave.

637
00:33:51,065 --> 00:33:52,205
But...

638
00:33:54,425 --> 00:33:55,605
Yes.

639
00:33:55,985 --> 00:33:57,165
Wait.

640
00:33:57,545 --> 00:33:59,885
I saw that you were also injured today.

641
00:34:00,625 --> 00:34:01,765
You have worked hard.

642
00:34:02,145 --> 00:34:03,525
Rest early.

643
00:34:04,745 --> 00:34:06,805
So Your Majesty was concerned about me.

644
00:34:07,385 --> 00:34:08,725
Thank you, Your Majesty.

645
00:34:23,825 --> 00:34:26,121
Meng Tinghui, Director of the
Bureau of Intelligence,

646
00:34:26,145 --> 00:34:28,681
uncovered the Tiger Roar Gang's
gambling operation,

647
00:34:28,705 --> 00:34:30,721
rescued numerous female scholars,

648
00:34:30,745 --> 00:34:32,721
and eliminated corrupt
officials from the court.

649
00:34:32,745 --> 00:34:33,721
Her service is outstanding.

650
00:34:33,745 --> 00:34:36,641
She is hereby promoted from
Secondary Sixth Rank to Secondary Fifth Rank

651
00:34:36,665 --> 00:34:38,441
as a reward.

652
00:34:38,465 --> 00:34:39,601
Furthermore,

653
00:34:39,625 --> 00:34:41,921
all members of the Bureau of
Intelligence are also to be rewarded

654
00:34:41,945 --> 00:34:43,285
in recognition of their merit.

655
00:34:45,905 --> 00:34:47,605
Thank you for Your Majesty's great grace.

656
00:34:54,825 --> 00:34:55,965
Your Majesty,

657
00:34:56,745 --> 00:34:58,521
countless families have been torn apart,

658
00:34:58,545 --> 00:34:59,761
and countless homes destroyed,

659
00:34:59,785 --> 00:35:01,881
all because of gambling.

660
00:35:01,905 --> 00:35:04,681
Xingrong Gambling House was
not only involved in crime,

661
00:35:04,705 --> 00:35:06,241
but also abducted and
trafficked innocent women,

662
00:35:06,265 --> 00:35:07,921
while winning over court officials.

663
00:35:07,945 --> 00:35:08,881
It harmed the state and the people

664
00:35:08,905 --> 00:35:10,645
and was truly a grave national threat.

665
00:35:10,905 --> 00:35:13,205
I ask Your Majesty to protect
all women under heaven

666
00:35:13,745 --> 00:35:16,401
and prevent such tragedies
from happening again.

667
00:35:16,425 --> 00:35:18,165
That is precisely my intention.

668
00:35:18,625 --> 00:35:19,761
Chief Steward You.

669
00:35:19,785 --> 00:35:20,801
Proclaim the decree.

670
00:35:20,825 --> 00:35:22,641
From this day onward,

671
00:35:22,665 --> 00:35:24,121
anyone who abducts or traffics people,

672
00:35:24,145 --> 00:35:26,921
once convicted, whether
principal or accomplice,

673
00:35:26,945 --> 00:35:28,281
shall be executed immediately.

674
00:35:28,305 --> 00:35:29,881
Their property shall be confiscated,

675
00:35:29,905 --> 00:35:32,161
and their families exiled
three thousand li.

676
00:35:32,185 --> 00:35:34,561
Every prefecture must
conduct strict inspections

677
00:35:34,585 --> 00:35:36,041
to prevent abduction and fraud.

678
00:35:36,065 --> 00:35:37,441
Any negligence

679
00:35:37,465 --> 00:35:38,801
will be severely punished.

680
00:35:38,825 --> 00:35:40,201
Furthermore, throughout Great Ning,

681
00:35:40,225 --> 00:35:42,401
all gambling is prohibited.

682
00:35:42,425 --> 00:35:44,361
Anyone who operates a gambling house:

683
00:35:44,385 --> 00:35:47,321
the principal offender shall be beheaded,
and accomplices flogged one hundred strokes

684
00:35:47,345 --> 00:35:48,961
and exiled one thousand li.

685
00:35:48,985 --> 00:35:50,561
Gamblers shall be flogged
eight hundred strokes

686
00:35:50,585 --> 00:35:52,241
and fined one hundred taels.

687
00:35:52,265 --> 00:35:54,401
Every prefecture must investigate
and enforce this strictly.

688
00:35:54,425 --> 00:35:56,921
Anyone who shields offenders
will receive the same punishment.

689
00:35:56,945 --> 00:35:59,561
Thank you, Official Meng,
for saving us from misery.

690
00:35:59,585 --> 00:36:00,961
Thank you, Assistant Shen.

691
00:36:00,985 --> 00:36:02,881
Thank you, my lords.

692
00:36:02,905 --> 00:36:04,841
Scholars, there is no need to thank us.

693
00:36:04,865 --> 00:36:06,601
We have reported the matter to the court

694
00:36:06,625 --> 00:36:08,121
and requested compensation for you.

695
00:36:08,145 --> 00:36:09,561
Those who wish to return home

696
00:36:09,585 --> 00:36:11,161
will be given sufficient travel expenses.

697
00:36:11,185 --> 00:36:12,681
Those who wish to remain in the capital

698
00:36:12,705 --> 00:36:14,121
will be properly settled.

699
00:36:14,145 --> 00:36:15,761
Anyone who wishes to take
the imperial examination

700
00:36:15,785 --> 00:36:18,001
will receive the Bureau's
full recommendation.

701
00:36:18,025 --> 00:36:20,645
The Bureau of Intelligence
will be your steadfast support.

702
00:36:21,945 --> 00:36:22,841
Official Meng,

703
00:36:22,865 --> 00:36:24,121
although I have suffered greatly,

704
00:36:24,145 --> 00:36:25,641
I still wish to take the
imperial examination,

705
00:36:25,665 --> 00:36:27,281
earn official honors like you,

706
00:36:27,305 --> 00:36:28,565
and become a good official.

707
00:36:28,865 --> 00:36:30,681
My hometown lies far on the frontier.

708
00:36:30,705 --> 00:36:32,601
Most women there are
confined to their homes.

709
00:36:32,625 --> 00:36:34,165
I wish to return and teach,

710
00:36:34,425 --> 00:36:35,641
so they may know

711
00:36:35,665 --> 00:36:38,401
that women can also carve
out a world for themselves.

712
00:36:38,425 --> 00:36:41,085
Women indeed face greater
hardship than men in this world.

713
00:36:41,345 --> 00:36:42,801
But as long as there
is light in your hearts,

714
00:36:42,825 --> 00:36:44,525
the clouds will part to reveal the sun.

715
00:36:44,785 --> 00:36:46,685
Seeing that you possess such resolve,

716
00:36:46,985 --> 00:36:48,401
we can rest easy.

717
00:36:48,425 --> 00:36:49,765
Education

718
00:36:50,665 --> 00:36:52,441
will always give people hope.

719
00:36:52,465 --> 00:36:53,801
Thank you, Official Meng.

720
00:36:53,825 --> 00:36:55,201
Thank you, Assistant Shen.

721
00:36:55,225 --> 00:36:57,085
You are all role models for women.

722
00:37:35,785 --> 00:37:37,681
With a blade hanging at your neck,

723
00:37:37,705 --> 00:37:40,285
you still have the leisure
for such refinement?

724
00:37:40,545 --> 00:37:42,281
Why are you in such a hurry, brother?

725
00:37:42,305 --> 00:37:44,281
Are you afraid the flames
will burn too fiercely

726
00:37:44,305 --> 00:37:46,605
and scorch that official robe of yours?

727
00:37:47,505 --> 00:37:49,925
Hao Wenming is on the
Bureau's torture rack.

728
00:37:50,425 --> 00:37:53,041
How long do you think he
can hold out before talking?

729
00:37:53,065 --> 00:37:55,361
If he dares reveal another word,

730
00:37:55,385 --> 00:37:56,961
I will have his entire
family buried with him.

731
00:37:56,985 --> 00:37:57,921
Restrain yourself,

732
00:37:57,945 --> 00:38:00,405
next time it will be the
Divine Guard who comes.

733
00:38:01,145 --> 00:38:04,045
Such imposing official authority, brother.

734
00:38:05,345 --> 00:38:07,685
When you used my
gambling house's honey trap

735
00:38:07,985 --> 00:38:10,445
to pave the way for your promotion,

736
00:38:11,785 --> 00:38:14,045
where was this mercy of yours?

737
00:38:14,225 --> 00:38:16,005
Now that the matter has been exposed,

738
00:38:16,345 --> 00:38:18,245
you wish to burn the
bridge after crossing it?

739
00:38:19,065 --> 00:38:21,401
The gambling ban costs me
ten thousand taels every day.

740
00:38:21,425 --> 00:38:23,361
I must settle this debt.

741
00:38:23,385 --> 00:38:25,161
You are utterly insane.

742
00:38:25,185 --> 00:38:27,641
Do you wish to repeat

743
00:38:27,665 --> 00:38:28,965
sacrificing your kin for justice?

744
00:38:30,945 --> 00:38:32,241
Over the years,

745
00:38:32,265 --> 00:38:34,001
every illicit payment you accepted

746
00:38:34,025 --> 00:38:35,601
is recorded here.

747
00:38:35,625 --> 00:38:38,325
The Bureau of Intelligence
will certainly be interested.

748
00:38:38,785 --> 00:38:39,681
Do not worry.

749
00:38:39,705 --> 00:38:42,965
I value family even more than you do.

750
00:38:43,705 --> 00:38:46,325
After all, you are my only blood relative.

751
00:38:47,545 --> 00:38:48,925
What happened back then

752
00:38:50,665 --> 00:38:52,321
was my fault.

753
00:38:52,345 --> 00:38:54,005
But at the time,

754
00:38:54,385 --> 00:38:56,205
I had no other choice.

755
00:38:57,825 --> 00:38:59,965
Though we were born of different mothers,

756
00:39:01,025 --> 00:39:03,805
that day, when you were pinned
in the mud and begged for help,

757
00:39:04,985 --> 00:39:06,281
the way you called me "brother"

758
00:39:06,305 --> 00:39:08,285
has stayed with me for twenty years.

759
00:39:11,305 --> 00:39:13,801
Do you think the Tiger Roar Gang
reached this point

760
00:39:13,825 --> 00:39:15,921
through luck alone?

761
00:39:15,945 --> 00:39:17,365
Then now,

762
00:39:18,425 --> 00:39:21,641
can you turn the gambling ban
into a worthless piece of paper?

763
00:39:21,665 --> 00:39:23,805
I will do everything possible
to maneuver at court.

764
00:39:25,865 --> 00:39:27,441
But you must restrain yourself.

765
00:39:27,465 --> 00:39:31,245
For now, do not make another
move against Meng Tinghui.

